<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI25-RBQA-F002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI25-RBQA-F002" ;
  triage:title "No mechanical boundary-enforcement gate for reload/startup validation parity" ;
  triage:description "The repo already has AST-based single-call-site guards for other invariants (AI.12 routing, AI.16 reconciliation) but none covering 'every trust-install path must route through the retained validator' -- exactly the class of gap that produced AI25-RBQA-F001 (refresh_https_trust bypassing validate_enabled_peer_configuration). This is a process/tooling-gap finding, not a code defect itself." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "FTQ" ;
  triage:severity "Important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "process/tooling" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-25T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s21pre-crosshost-evidence-harness/42fbd9fa> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s22-loopback-self-send-exemption/a5aa6813> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s23-crosshost-shared-write-path/c528137c> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s24-host-qualified-ack-receipt/c326cbe7> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s25-peer-authority-resolution/b49f0840> ;
  triage:highestOpenBranch "feature/pAI-s25-peer-authority-resolution" ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s25-peer-authority-resolution/b49f0840> ;
  triage:notes "Non-repeatable finding first introduced by the AI.25/AICH-S5 work. Finding is a structural/process gap (missing lint/gate mechanism), not a concrete code occurrence. AST-based guard patterns exist for AI.12 (canonical_write_router_has_one_host_routing_decision) and AI.16 (reconciliation_delivery_calls) in crates/atm-architecture/tests/boundary_enforcement.rs. Similar guard needed to enforce 'every trust-install path must route through validate_enabled_peer_configuration'. Gap exists on all branches where trust-install path exists (s21+). Dispatch requires creation of new boundary-enforcement test gate." .

